### 本機測試環境 — MinIO + Nextcloud 外部儲存驗證
### 前置：bash docker/test/setup-test-env.sh
###
### Nextcloud: http://localhost:8085  (admin / password123)
### MinIO API:  http://localhost:9000  (minioadmin / minioadminpw)
### MinIO UI:   http://localhost:9001

@BASE = http://localhost:8085
@ADMIN = admin:password123

### 1. 列出所有外部儲存（應含 chad 的「個人雲端硬碟」）
GET {{BASE}}/apps/files_external/globalstorages
Authorization: Basic {{ADMIN}}
OCS-APIRequest: true

### 2. 僅查 chad 適用的掛載（applicableUsers 含 chad）
# 從上一步回應中找 mountPoint=/個人雲端硬碟 且 applicableUsers=["chad"]

### 3. 以 chad 身分列出檔案（WebDAV PROPFIND）
# 需 chad 密碼；路徑為掛載點名稱
# PROPFIND {{BASE}}/remote.php/dav/files/chad/個人雲端硬碟/
# Authorization: Basic chad:<chad密碼>

### 4. API 建立 chad 掛載（等同 mounts-local-test.json 第一筆，手動測試用）
POST {{BASE}}/apps/files_external/globalstorages
Authorization: Basic {{ADMIN}}
OCS-APIRequest: true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mountPoint": "/個人雲端硬碟",
  "backend": "amazons3",
  "authMechanism": "amazons3::accesskey",
  "backendOptions": {
    "bucket": "chad-filespace",
    "hostname": "minio1",
    "port": "9000",
    "region": "us-east-1",
    "use_ssl": false,
    "use_path_style": true,
    "legacy_auth": false,
    "useMultipartCopy": true,
    "key": "minioadmin",
    "secret": "minioadminpw"
  },
  "mountOptions": {},
  "applicableUsers": ["chad"],
  "applicableGroups": []
}

### 5. 確認使用者存在
GET {{BASE}}/ocs/v2.php/cloud/users/chad?format=json
Authorization: Basic {{ADMIN}}
OCS-APIRequest: true
Accept: application/json

GET {{BASE}}/ocs/v2.php/cloud/users/usr01?format=json
Authorization: Basic {{ADMIN}}
OCS-APIRequest: true
Accept: application/json

GET {{BASE}}/ocs/v2.php/cloud/users/00059094?format=json
Authorization: Basic {{ADMIN}}
OCS-APIRequest: true
Accept: application/json
